# i18n (slang)

- Never hardcode user-visible strings in Dart.
- Add keys to both `*_en.i18n.json` and `*_fa.i18n.json` in the same change.
- After edits: `melos run translations`.
- Prefer existing key namespaces in the owning feature; do not invent parallel trees.
- Theme / RTL details: `docs/architecture/08-i18n-theming.md`.
